<title>USA: Affinity Technology hires a CFO.</title>
<headline>Affinity Technology hires a CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affinity Technology Group Inc said Tuesday Joseph A. Boyle, a partner in Price Waterhouse LLP, has joined the company as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said he succeeds Carl Donnelly, who has become vice president, mergers and acquisitions, a newly-created position.</p>
<p>It also said Ernest A. Morton, former head of Mellon Bank Corp's consumer lending operations, has been named senior group executive, retail strategy.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
